                    <xs:documentation>The Duration of the MusicVideo (using the ISO 8601:2004 PT[[hhH]mmM]ssS format, where lower case characters indicate variables, upper case characters are part of the string, e.g. one hour, two minutes and three seconds would be PT1H2M3S).</xs:documentation>
                </xs:annotation>
            </xs:element>
            <xs:element name="MWLI" type="xs:string" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="unbounded">
